'''Galarian Obstagoon''' (Japanese: '''ガラルタチフサグマ''' ''Galarian Tachifusaguma'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

