==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Galarian Obstagoon|161}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion; both cards have the Merciless Strike attack.
*'''Merciless Strike''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Type: Null|115}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

